  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Have you ever seen a smiling avocado "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "avocado",
      "zh": "牛油果"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " or a slice of toast with tiny legs? These cute characters are Jellycats, and they have taken the world by storm."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "The story began in 1999 when two brothers decided to make toys that were more fun. They chose a playful name, “Jellycat”, inspired by a young child who loved jelly and cats. From the very start, the brand wanted to make people smile. But how did these toys become so popular with everyone from little kids to tired adults?"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "One major reason is that Jellycat turns almost everything into a character. They don’t just sell ordinary stuffed animals. Instead, they give each toy a name and a personality. For example, if you buy an octopus "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "octopus",
      "zh": "章鱼"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", you are “"
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "adopting",
      "ref": "v-adopt"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "” Odell Octopus. On their website, every toy has its own story to tell. The designers turn everyday things, like coffee cups, plants, and food, into friendly characters with faces. Because of these details, people feel like they are choosing a new friend, not just buying a toy."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "This special connection is also why so many adults love Jellycat toys. These soft toys provide a sense of comfort, and many people call them emotional support friends. On social media, fans share videos of their toys’ daily lives. They "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "post",
      "ref": "v-post"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " unboxing clips "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "unboxing clips",
      "zh": "拆箱视频"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", dress their plushies in special outfits, and film their adventures in the real world. This "
     },
     {
      "t": "underline",
      "v": "organic"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " sharing has gained huge attention online. Without much traditional marketing, the brand has become a global superstar because its fans promote it voluntarily."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p5",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "What Jellycat sells is not just plush toys. It sells joy, connection, and a little piece of comfort. In a busy and sometimes harsh "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "harsh",
      "zh": "残酷的"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " world, Jellycat offers a smiling remedy "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "remedy",
      "zh": "治疗"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". And that, it turns out, is what captures everyone’s heart."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
